      "sourceTextSha256": "bad690e44e9a29a4a8956bd4088d9aa17a320d011be6f12e78b59cafa1ef66f8",
      "text": "After breakfast, take a walk through the picturesque streets of the town of Copacabana, visit the Church that houses the Dark Virgin, the local market where the famous pasankallas and Bolivian sweet andean popcorn are offered for sale. Return in shared tourist transport to the city of La Paz. Passenger concentration at approximately 13:30 in the lobby of Hotel Rosario Lago Titicaca and departure at 14:00. Arrival in La Paz.",
